  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strategic Impact Fund for the Occupied Palestinian Territories</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve the quality of DFID&#x2019;s and partners&#x2019; work in the Occupied Palestinian Territories by ensuring that resources are used to deliver high quality programmes, which improve the lives of Palestinian people and contribute to a two state solution.  To achieve this DFID will fund at least 12 small projects over 4 years until March 2015.  These projects will generate new evidence, new pilot studies and new ways of working which will strengthen the evidence base for DFID and partners programmes, improve DFID&#x2019;s influencing ability with donors and the wider community and support innovation to drive improvements in project delivery and value for money.</narrative>
  </description>
